			"date": "2021-03-15T15:09:42.000Z",
			"content": "More from <a href=\"https://twitter.com/changelog\">@changelog</a>:\n\n<a href=\"https://twitter.com/zachleat\">@zachleat</a>’s Queue Code is a…hmm…coding simulator? Point it at a Gist and then just type!\n\nGreat for presentations, screen sharing, or showing off!\n\n<a href=\"https://www.zachleat.com/web/queue-code/\">zachleat.com/web/queue-code/</a>\n<a href=\"https://queuecode.zachleat.dev/\">queuecode.zachleat.dev</a>\n\nhttps://t.co/GrPLMnX79L",
