		{
			"id": 1103544,
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://www.bram.us/2021/04/01/this-web-site-is-a-tech-talk/",
			"author": {
				"name": "Bramus!",
				"url": "https://www.bram.us/author/bramus/"
			},
			"date": "2021-04-01T16:14:48.000Z",
			"content": "<p>&lt;img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.bram.us/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/znLxHkdtQzk.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-28033\" srcset=\"https://www.bram.us/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/znLxHkdtQzk.jpg 1280w, https://www.bram.us/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/znLxHkdtQzk-560x315.jpg 560w, https://www.bram.us/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/znLxHkdtQzk-1120x630.jpg 1120w, https://www.bram.us/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/znLxHkdtQzk-768x432.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 560px) 100vw, 560px\" /&gt;</p>\n<p>Great talk by <a href=\"https://twitter.com/zachleat\">Zach Leatherman</a> as recorded at <a href=\"https://smashingconf.com/austin-2020/\">Smashing Conf Austin 2020</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>The talk delves into Single Page Applications, Multi Page Applications, modern JavaScript Frameworks, and what I believe to be a better future for web development.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>/me nods along for the entirety of this talk.</p>\n<p>Powering his faux-live-coding slidedeck is <a href=\"https://www.zachleat.com/web/queue-code/\">Queue Code</a>, a service to let you live code like he did in this talk.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.zachleat.com/web/this-website-is-a-tech-talk/\">This Web Site is a Tech Talk <em>(incl. resources)</em> →</a></p>",
